  "statement": "The main technical risk is that the central premise is false in the closest tested regime: off-chain context triples contributed +0.003 F1 at inference, extra triples are framed as noise by subgraph retrieval work, and the two auxiliary components (one-hop failure repair, low-hop RL) are already addressed by intermediate-supervision and reward-shaping mechanisms. If fine-tuning does not change this, the pipeline's contribution reduces to re-deriving known results with more compute.",
